  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모멘트(수원) 선생님의 글입니다.</span></p><p><br></p><font size=\"2\"><p>여기에서 검색해보니 블루마블 식으로 암석의 순환을 게임처럼 만든 자료가 있더라고요.</p><p>그 아이디어도 좋다고 생각했고, 저는 불현듯 끝말 잇기 게임을 응용해보면 어떻까 생각했어요.</p><p>암석이 순환한다는 것과 순환 과정에서 나오는 몇 가지 작용(?, 과정?)을 깨우치는 게 중요하게 다루는 것 같아서 반복하면 뭔가 좋지 않을까 싶어 떠올려 본 아이디어입니다.</p><p><br></p><p>모둠&nbsp;내에서 순서를 정하고 각자&nbsp;( 마그마, 화성암, 퇴적물, 퇴적암, 변성암, 녹음, 식음, 풍화/침식/운반, &#44421;어짐, 높은 열과 압력 ) 이 용어 세트 중 하나씩을&nbsp;말하거나 쓰거나 해서 암석의 순환 고리를 계속 이어나가는&nbsp;방식으로...&nbsp;끝말 잇기를 응용해보면 어떨까 생각만 하고 있어요.</p><p><br></p><p>아직 해본 적이 없어서 모르겠어서 선생님들 피드백을 얻고 싶네요. ^^;</p><p><br></p></font><p>-------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">'아이앰 그라운드 자기소개하기'</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">형식으로 해보면 어떨까요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? ^^</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠부터 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠까지 해당 단어를 하나씩 맡게 하고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">  </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">화성암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) : </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">쿵짝 화성암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">꿍짝 열과 압력</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">열과 압력</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) :&nbsp;앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 열과 압력</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 변성암</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">9</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">변성암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) :&nbsp;앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 변성암</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 풍화침식</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">모둠</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(풍화침식</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) :&nbsp;앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 풍화침식</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 앗싸</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> 퇴적암&nbsp; ~~~</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이렇게요</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">그리고 각 모둠은&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">해당 단어에 맞는 동작도 만들면 재미있겠습니다~&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; fo